        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LKE150SBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Lake Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 different types of wood, the Lake 1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Brass Wrap Around Mounts is great for both residential and commercial use. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The brackets are available in a huge selection of finishes. This wooden door pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/lake-1-inch-wooden-door-pull-with-brass-wrap-around-mounts-first-impressions-lke100sbr\"><b>1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LKE150SBR Lake Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LKE02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262338\"><b>First Impressions LKE150SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LKE150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Lake 1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Brass Wrap Around Mounts",
                "description": "Available in 4 different types of wood, the Lake 1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Brass Wrap Around Mounts is great for both residential and commercial use. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The brackets are available in a huge selection of finishes. This wooden door pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n",
